  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x201c;Support to NRC Consortium under the Resilience and Adaptation Fund (RAF)&#x201d; project funded by the Foreign, Commonwealth and Development Office (FCDO) and led by NRC (consortium lead), DRC, IRC and HI, in collaboration with local partners, addresses critical challenges faced by both Rohingya refugees and host communities in Cox&#x2019;s Bazar, Bangladesh, related to climate vulnerability, environmental degradation, and limited livelihood opportunities.</narrative>
